nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">商汤开源SenseNova-Vision统一视觉大模型，单模型覆盖四大核心视觉任务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI因需求激增取消GPT-5.6Sol订阅用户使用限制并优化算力</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude Code内置浏览器功能，实现网页跨平台交互与安全写入</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团开源SingGuard-NSFA与SingGuard两款AI安全护栏模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7a7f1a18e61169b285d21673eabfbe3f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月13日，蚂蚁AI安全实验室宣布开源智能体安全护栏SingGuard-NSFA，并披露多模态安全护栏SingGuard详细信息。SingGuard-NSFA专为智能体行为安全设计，基于CIA原则，将风险细分为7大类、28个中类及185个场景，提供0.8B至9B四种规模，支持50毫秒内完成风险判定，适用于高并发实时拦截。SingGuard则面向多模态交互场景，建立统一安全判断框架，支持运行时动态加载自然语言安全规则，无需重训即可更新。在多项评测中，SingGuard在文本、图像及跨模态内容识别上表现优于Llama Guard3、ShieldGemma等主流模型。上述技术已应用于蚂蚁阿福、AI版支付宝等业务，旨在解决大模型从内容生成转向自主执行过程中，提示词注入、权限滥用及恶意代码执行等前沿安全挑战，为行业提供系</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软全面引入MDASH系统挖掘Windows漏洞，安全补丁修复量增长近七成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/72a61727a122c383636ff6a52d4fbb43.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软Windows与设备部门执行副总裁Pavan Davuluri宣布，Windows团队已全面引入多模态AI安全系统MDASH（Microsoft Detection and Analysis for Security Hardening）用于挖掘系统漏洞。该系统通过扫描关键二进制文件并结合多个AI模型分析潜在风险，经专用流程过滤误报后由工程师确认。AI不仅用于漏洞发现，还协助工程师分析成因、生成修补方案及自动挑选回归测试项目，但最终修补程序仍需人工审核。得益于此，今年6月Patch Tuesday修复漏洞数约200个，较5月的118个增长近70%。微软强调，此举旨在提升漏洞识别与修复效率，而非系统漏洞增多。随着AI深入操作系统安全核心，未来Windows安全更新的修复数量预计将持续攀升，用户将获得更及时的系</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">商汤开源SenseNova-Vision统一视觉大模型，单模型覆盖四大核心视觉任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/17e37085aefd4e2c85d9c33380f9e108.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">商汤科技正式发布并全面开源日日新SenseNova-Vision理解生成统一视觉大模型，标志着视觉能力正式融入通用大模型体系。该模型摒弃了传统将检测、分割、深度预测等专家模型打包的割裂方案，通过原生能力实现单模型对四大核心视觉领域的覆盖。在结构化视觉理解、稠密几何预测、全景分割及多视角3D重建任务中，SenseNova-Vision性能均比肩甚至超越专用专家模型，并在多项指标上实现对Vision Banana的代际领先。商汤同步开源了包含5000万条样本的视觉指令语料库SenseNova-Vision Corpus-50M，以支持开发者进行深度研究。该模型不仅在稠密小目标检测、长尾识别等复杂场景表现突出，还具备极高的几何预测精度。未来，商汤将把SenseNova-Vision的核心技术全面整合至日日新U系列大模</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI因需求激增取消GPT-5.6Sol订阅用户使用限制并优化算力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c837f4493d467314bec37c70ee75d9b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">由于旗舰模型GPT-5.6Sol在过去48小时内需求爆发式增长，OpenAI今日宣布临时取消面向Plus、Pro及Business订阅用户的5小时使用限制，并对所有用户进行了一次性额度重置。此次调整旨在应对Codex和ChatGPT Work极高的使用强度，确保用户编程与Agent工作流不受影响。OpenAI产品负责人Tibo表示，平台正同步优化GPT-5.6Sol运行效率，通过提升Token生成效率与底层架构轻量化，降低实际算力消耗。此举不仅是应对短期流量冲击的应急措施，更标志着大模型行业正从参数竞争转向落地工程化与运营降本。随着旗舰模型运行效率提升与服务限制放宽，AI工作流在商业与开发端的深度渗透将进一步加速，为行业算力普惠与应用爆发提供底层支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude Code内置浏览器功能，实现网页跨平台交互与安全写入</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8618499e2d5ae6826a92fd09e16e6735.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月12日，Anthropic宣布为AI编程助手Claude Code集成内置浏览器窗口，使其具备直接读取、点击及输入外部网页内容的原生交互能力。该功能支持Claude无缝跨越本地与云端界面，高效处理文档网站与问题跟踪器等资源。在安全架构上，内置浏览器采用独立配置文件运行，不保存用户登录信息，并通过分类器严格过滤写入操作，默认拦截购买、账户创建及绕过验证码等行为。企业用户可通过白名单机制限制访问范围或完全禁用该工具。此次更新作为Agent演进的重要一步，在提升开发者工作流连贯性的同时，为AI辅助编程工具在复杂网络环境下的安全落地提供了兼顾效率与合规的行业参考。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
